# DoctorChaosNpc (32033), a civilian, talked to: it says NpcString 1010578 and releases the client
# (the talk's leading ActionFailed, its line, the release); 2 s later it only sets off for its
# machine, saying nothing. Its walks, the cutscene's lines, cameras and social action, the party
# teleport and the golem it raises are in tests/ai/boss_drchaos_test.go, as the format renders no
# civilian's desires, camera, social action or NPC walk. Expectations are derived from the
# reference source (DoctorChaosNpc.java onFirstTalk, onTimer 1001).
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.drchaos.DoctorChaosNpc
npc chaos 32033 Folk 60 0 0 walks

action chaos
action chaos
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcSay obj=chaos type=0 npc=1032033 text="How dare you trespass into my territory! Have you no fear?"
  S ActionFailed
advance 2s
tick
